    dct:bibliographicCitation "Source: ClinVar, National Center for Biotechnology Information, U.S. National Library of Medicine; Landrum MJ et al., Nucleic Acids Res. 2018;46(D1):D1062-D1067, PMID 29165669. NCBI places no restrictions on the use or distribution of the data. Some submitters may claim patent, copyright, or other intellectual property rights in all or a portion of the data, which NCBI is not in a position to assess. ClinVar data is not intended for direct diagnostic use or medical decision-making without review by a genetics professional." ;
